## Summary
CodeDev Group, also known as The Unreal Guys, has launched a new development studio named Full Spectrum Interactive. This expansion marks the group's entry into creating interactive content. The studio's focus aligns with the group's expertise, particularly with Unreal Engine, given their previous branding.

